Error [E0989]: This `prep if` condition can't be known at compile time
  --> tests/ui/comptime_if_noncomptime_cond.jet:3:13
    |
  3 |     prep if x {
    |             ^
 Why: A `prep if` condition must be a known-time expression — a prepared value, a literal, or a pure function call with known arguments (D-WHEN1)
 Fix: Prepare the value first: `flag :: prep { … }`, then write `prep if flag { … }`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0989
